## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
*.user

## Local/user secrets - never commit real credentials
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
secrets.json
*.pfx

## User-uploaded content — NEVER commit real client/user data to source
## control. Case documents are legal client data (compliance-sensitive);
## profile pictures are real people's personal images. Both belong in
## actual storage (disk backup / object storage), not git history, which
## is permanent, often shared with contractors/CI, and never meant to be
## a place to keep PII or confidential documents.
wwwroot/uploads/
SecureStorage/
!SecureStorage/.gitkeep

